      "lastUpdateTime": "2026-01-29 11:43:00",
      "oanoAttmName": "关于填报义乌市国家儿童友好城市建设相关工作情况的通知.PDF<br>附件1-3 完成情况复盘清单.docx<br>附件4-6 计划清单.docx<br>附件7 义乌市妇女儿童活动中心链接优质资源清单.docx",
      "oanoContent": "<p style=\";text-align: center;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 29px\"><span style=\"font-family:方正小标宋简体\">关于填报义乌市国家儿童友好城市建设</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: center;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 29px\"><span style=\"font-family:方正小标宋简体\">相关工作情况的通知</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">各</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">相关</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">单位：</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">为</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">深化</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">国家儿童友好城市建设，回望与复盘儿童友好领域重点任务完成情况，</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">谋划与推进</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">2026<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">年度</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">国家</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">儿童友好城市</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">建设重点工作</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">。请各单位围绕</span>“<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">社会政策友好、公共服务友好、权利保障友好、成长空间友好、发展环境友好、共享融合友好</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">六大友好体系，立足本部门职能，据实填报七张清单（附件</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">1-</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">7</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">）。其中，附件</span>1-3<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">为</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">完成情况</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">复盘清单（</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">附件</span>1<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">需</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">另附佐证材料），附件</span>4-6<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">为计划清单，</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">附件</span>7<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">为</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市妇女儿童活动中心链接优质资源清单</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">。</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">请各单位</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">于</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">下周三（</span>1<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">28</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">日）上午</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">12</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">时前，将清单</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">报送反馈至义乌市妇女儿童工作委员会办公室朱方圆处（联系电话：</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">6550464/13867905064</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">）。</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">附件：</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">1.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市儿童友好城市建设十类儿童友好品牌项目清</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 128px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">单（完成情况复盘）；</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 107px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">2.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市儿童友好城市建设空间场景清单（完成情况</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 128px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">复盘）；</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 107px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">3.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市儿童友好城市建设项目清单（完成情况复盘）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0 0 0 128px;text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">4.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">年度儿童友好城市建设空间场景建设 清单（计划）；</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 107px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">5.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">年度儿童友好城市建设示范服务项目 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 128px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">清单（计划）；</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 107px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">6.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">年度儿童友好城市建设重点项目清单</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 128px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">（计划）；</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 107px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">7.<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市妇女儿童活动中心链接优质资源清单。</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";text-align: right;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">义乌市妇女儿童工作委员会办公室</span></span></p><p style=\";text-align: center;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);white-space: normal;text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">2026<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 21px\">3<span style=\"font-family:宋体_GB2312\">日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>",
